    {
      "id": 44,
      "type": "MarkdownNote",
      "pos": [
        2400,
        0
      ],
      "size": [
        520,
        700
      ],
      "flags": {},
      "order": 44,
      "mode": 0,
      "inputs": [],
      "outputs": [],
      "properties": {},
      "widgets_values": [
        "## LTX-2.5 MSR multi-reference (LiconStudio V2)\n\nUp to 5 references: pic1..pic4 + background. pic1 is required; references must be contiguous (pic1, pic2, ...). To skip one, **delete the link** to both guide nodes (or delete the Load Image node).\n\n**Prompt:** name references as `Image 1`, `Image 2`, ... and say which provides character / clothing / object / background and where they stand.\n\nStage 1 default 832x480 -> stage 2 = 1664x960.\n\nRequires custom node **ComfyUI-LTX2.5-MSR** and `LTX-2.5-Licon-MSR-V2.safetensors` in models/loras.\n\nAudio references (optional): add `Load Audio` -> `LTXV Audio VAE Encode` -> guide `audio_ref1/2` on both guides.\n\n**OOM?** MSR adds reference tokens, so it needs more VRAM than plain I2V: drop to Q5/Q4 GGUF, 3 references, or 97 frames.\n"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 45,
      "type": "MarkdownNote",
      "pos": [
        -580,
        0
      ],
      "size": [
        540,
        820
      ],
      "flags": {},
      "order": 44,
      "mode": 0,
      "inputs": [],
      "outputs": [],
      "title": "HOW TO: MSR References, Length & Resolution",
      "properties": {
        "Node name for S&R": "MarkdownNote"
      },
      "widgets_values": [
        "## HOW TO: MSR References, Length & Resolution\n\n### 1. Required setup\n- Custom node: `ComfyUI-LTX2.5-MSR` (`liconstudio/ComfyUI-LTX2.5-MSR`)\n- LoRA: `LTX-2.5-Licon-MSR-V2.safetensors` in `models/loras/`\n- If you use your `ltx25_uncensored_*` GGUF/CLIP/VAE files, select them in Group 1 loaders.\n\n### 2. How to use MSR references (`pic1`..`pic4` + `background`)\n- `pic1` is required. Keep character portraits contiguous (`pic1`, `pic2`, `pic3`...).\n- For fewer refs: disconnect unused `picN` links on **BOTH** Stage 1 & Stage 2 MSR guide nodes (or only Stage 1 in Single-Stage).\n- In your prompt, refer to them explicitly as **`Image 1`**, **`Image 2`**, **`Image 3`**... and state who does what (\"Image 1 on the left talks to Image 2 on the right\").\n- **Keep `LTXVCropGuides` enabled** \u2014 it strips the reference frames before decode.\n\n### 3. Length & Resolution (RTX 3090 24 GB)\n- MSR uses more VRAM than plain I2V -> start at **`832\u00d7480`** (2-stage -> `1664\u00d7960`) or **`768\u00d7448`** (2-stage -> `1536\u00d7896`) and **`5s`** (121 frames).\n- Width/height must be **divisible by 32**; frames must be **`8n + 1`** (`97`, `121`, `145`, `193`, `241` @ 24fps).\n- If OOM: lower `VAEDecodeTiled` `tile_size` (`512` -> `256`), reduce resolution, or use fewer reference images.\n"
      ],
      "color": "#233",
      "bgcolor": "#355"
    }
